{"title":"ACCESSORIES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003edatum dahleez’s accessories collection combines luxury, style, and function in every detail. From champagne sets to travel essentials and drinkware, each piece reflects the brand’s signature craftsmanship and sophistication. More than accessories, they’re refined essentials that elevate your everyday.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-rolltop-backpack","title":"Datum Dahleez ROLLTOP BACKPACK","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez \"EB\" rolltop backpack in black and blue, boasting the iconic Datum Dahleez logo for the ultimate sleek look. This backpack features inner laptop pockets, and has a 17.5 L capacity. Made from 100% nylon.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344093651291,"sku":"BU124U701BK","price":110.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/datum dahleez_backpack-01_2a2a47e2-19a4-4939-8f3b-dc744c5d3f13.jpg?v=1742416404"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-duffle-bag","title":"Datum Dahleez DUFFLE BAG","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez duffle bag comes in a black and blue design, boasting the iconic Datum Dahleez logo for the ultimate sleek look. This duffle bag has a 35 L capacity, and features handles and a wide shoulder strap for extra comfort and versatility. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344093913435,"sku":"BU124U702BL","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/datum dahleez_duffle-bag-01_89ba5057-263d-474a-92ad-35065e477605.jpg?v=1742416402"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb01","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB01","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB01 champagne is a vintage 2002 champagne created from 90% Chardonnay and 10% Pinot Noir. Blossoming floral aromas in the glass and everlasting smoothness and roundness on your pallet. A full-bodied vintage with crispy essences waltzes with lace-like bubbles in infinite whirls. The champagne unfolds a horizon of delightful green fruits and nuts, amplified by a jolting note of salty-minerality. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344147226971,"sku":"EB01","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c13_1_cc859739-9b84-4cf5-bcd1-3dcbb2072ad3.jpg?v=1742416347"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb02","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB02","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB02 cuvée is a vintage blanc de blancs 2006 boasts robe and fine bubbles, before opening-up to a large aromatic pallet with acacia notes, hazelnuts and stone fruits. The grape variety is 100% Chardonnay Grand Cru, which can be tasted both for aperitive, during a gastronomic meal or a happy moment of life, with raw ham of Pata Negra or a delicious caviar, this cuvée pairs well with all occasions. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344149160283,"sku":"EB02","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c5_ee7fb0ca-d3d4-4a2a-8bfe-f6fe0a1ae029.jpg?v=1742416346"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-champagne-carbon-eb03","title":"Datum Dahleez CHAMPAGNE CARBON EB03","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe EB03 cuvée is a 2013 vintage, which has initial scents of citrus, followed by aromas of spring flowers, then a growing intensity toward yellow citrus, toasty notes and aromatic herbs. On the palate it provides an initial intensity, followed by a creamier more velvety texture. The finish reveals hints of acidity. The grape variety is 100% Chardonnay Grand Cru, which will enhance a delicate recipe such as a scallop ceviche, a red tuna sashimi or a filet of Saint-Pierre with citrus fruits. The 750ml bottle is wrapped with Carbon Fiber. Packaging includes luxury box and free delivery all over Europe.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344151814491,"sku":"EB03","price":320.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/c9_786d28de-c6c0-48cd-9b82-be1dbbf2e496.jpg?v=1742416345"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eb-texture-socks-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez EB TEXTURE SOCKS BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMade from 100% mercerised cotton, these Datum Dahleez socks are comfortable for the foot, as well as the perfect subtle luxurious touch, featuring a criss-cross EB design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMEDIUM:41 - 42\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eLARGE: 43 - 44\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"M","offer_id":49344188907867,"sku":"BU220M901BL0M","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344188940635,"sku":"BU220M901BL0L","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220M901BL.jpg?v=1742416308"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eb-classic-socks-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez EB CLASSIC SOCKS BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMade from 100% mercerised cotton, these Datum Dahleez socks are comfortable for the foot, as well as the perfect subtle luxurious touch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eMEDIUM: 41 - 42\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eLARGE: 43 - 44\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"M","offer_id":49344190349659,"sku":"BU220M900BL0M","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344190382427,"sku":"BU220M900BL0L","price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220M900BL.jpg?v=1742416306"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-black-leather-credit-card-holder","title":"Datum Dahleez BLACK LEATHER CREDIT CARD HOLDER","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThis black leather credit card holder is a luxurious accessory for automotive enthusiasts everywhere, featuring a simple yet elegant embossed logo on the front. Made from leather with RFID technology.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344227017051,"sku":"BU220U802BK99","price":75.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220U802BK-CLOSED.jpg?v=1742416252"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-black-leather-macaron-wallet","title":"Datum Dahleez BLACK LEATHER MACARON WALLET","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Wallet is a luxurious accessory crafted from 100% hammered leather, offering a distinctive textured finish. Featuring the iconic Datum Dahleez branding, it provides ample space for cards and cash while maintaining a sleek, sophisticated profile. Perfect for those who appreciate premium craftsmanship and timeless style.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344230752603,"sku":"BU220U803BK99","price":100.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU220U803BK-CLOSED.jpg?v=1742416243"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-pouch-pc-tablet-neoprenne-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez POUCH PC-TABLET NEOPRENNE BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eFits most laptops up to 13.6 inches in screen size. The Datum Dahleez Laptop Case is a sleek and protective accessory designed to safeguard your device in style. Made of durable neoprene, it features a contemporary mesh front insert for added breathability and aesthetic appeal. Perfect for professionals on the move.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344238289243,"sku":"BU220U801BL99","price":65.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/BU_0001_Tonalita_saturazione2copia_22f3f07e-7b68-4a83-8f5c-cd038c3292c0.jpg?v=1742416232"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-store-gift-card","title":"Datum Dahleez STORE DIGITAL GIFT CARD","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGive the gift of choice with our versatile Gift Card! Whether it’s for a birthday, holiday, anniversary, or just to say thank you, this gift card is the perfect way to let your loved ones pick exactly what they want. Available in multiple denominations, it can be redeemed on a wide selection of products.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGift cards have a two year expiration and cannot be redeemed against Exclusive Lifestyle or Champagne products. Please note this is a digital gift card received via email and no physical card will be sent.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"€10.00","offer_id":49510467535195,"sku":null,"price":10.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"€25.00","offer_id":49510467567963,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"€50.00","offer_id":49510467600731,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"€100.00","offer_id":49510467633499,"sku":null,"price":100.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"€150.00","offer_id":49753247678811,"sku":null,"price":150.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/GIFT_CARD.jpg?v=1742416187"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-36g","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 36G","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 36G, the first beveled rimless frame for the collection. Available in a curated palette of custom horn and carbon fiber hues and feature signature EB spring hinges and mesh trim details, plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold. Adjustable, interchangable titanium and silicone nosepads are included. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 36G is complete with Ettore Datum Dahleez signature engraved 3mm thick lenses with a unique beveled polished edge and anti-reflective coatings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49816543625563,"sku":"36G-BK\/24K","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/36G-BK-SS_Front.jpg?v=1778573556"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-36h","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 36H","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 36H, a bold and sporty rimless frame shape. Available in a curated palette of custom horn and carbon fiber hues and feature signature EB spring hinges and mesh trim details, plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold. Adjustable, interchangable titanium and silicone nosepads are included. Datum Dahleez Eyewear model 36H is complete with Ettore Datum Dahleez signature engraved 3mm thick lenses with polished edge and anti-reflective coatings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49816573837659,"sku":"36H-BK\/24K","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/36H-BBS-SS_Front.jpg?v=1778573735"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-69","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 69","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 69 is a powerful and commanding square sunglass, sculptecd from thick Japanese cellulose acetate. Hand finished with laminated mesh grill pattern temple wire core and metal EB logo details. Datum Dahleez Eyewear model 69 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49816702746971,"sku":"69-BK\/WG","price":860.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/69-BK-WG_Front.jpg?v=1778574281"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-56","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 56","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 56 distills the collection’s design philosophy to its purest form – an ultra-light, all-titanium round frame that showcases material precision, technical mastery and understated elegance. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 56 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49833554444635,"sku":"56-14K","price":990.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/56-14K_Angle.jpg?v=1778573957"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-70","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 70","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 70 is an understated classic acetate sunglass hand crafted from Japanese cellulose acetate. Finished with Datum Dahleez details— radiator grill pattern pressed wire core, hex nut temple posts and laminated EB temple tips. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 70 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49833929048411,"sku":"70-BK\/SS","price":860.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/70-BK-24K_Front.jpg?v=1778574574"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-71","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 71","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 71 is round sunglass offering timeless sophistication. Hand crafted from Japanese cellulose acetate. Finished with Datum Dahleez details— radiator grill pattern pressed wire core, hex nut temple posts and laminated EB temple tips. Datum Dahleez Eyewear model 71 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49834501177691,"sku":"71-BK\/SS","price":860.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/71-BGN-WG_Front.jpg?v=1778574762"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-101","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 101","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 101 introduces a contemporary navigator silhouette with a combination acetate and titanium front grounded in classic proportions. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49834823844187,"sku":"101-MBK\/24K-BK","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/101-14K-BK_Angle.jpg?v=1778574943"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-102","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 102","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 102 introduces a contemporary navigator silhouette with a combination acetate and titanium front grounded in classic proportions. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 102 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49834852024667,"sku":"102-MBK\/24K-BK","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/102-14K-BK_Angle.jpg?v=1778575095"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-50","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 50","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 50 introduces a modern round silhouette that explores a sophisticated balance of structure and warmth through its titanium and acetate combination front. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 50 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49835069604187,"sku":"50-BK\/14K","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/50-BBS-BP_Angle.jpg?v=1778573211"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-36c","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 36 C","description":"\u003cp\u003eModel 36C, the first-ever rimless frame for the collection in a classic square lens shape. Available in a curated palette of custom horn and carbon fiber hues and feature signature EB spring hinges and mesh trim details, plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold. Adjustable, interchangable titanium and silicone nosepads are included. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 36C is Complete with Ettore Datum Dahleez signature engraved 3mm thick lenses with polished edge and anti-reflective coatings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49852780544347,"sku":"36C-BK\/24K","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/36C-BP-SS_Front.jpg?v=1778307524"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-carbon-fibre-pen","title":"Datum Dahleez CARBON FIBRE PEN","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted with precision and elegance, the Datum Dahleez Carbon Fibre Pen is a premium writing instrument that captures the essence of the legendary Datum Dahleez brand. Designed to elevate your daily writing experience, it brings a refined touch of luxury to every moment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920137589083,"sku":"5070003827800","price":45.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/25-1339-TransparentGlobalLimited0003.jpg?v=1753962283"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eb-water-bottle","title":"Datum Dahleez EB WATER BOTTLE","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStay refreshed in style with the Datum Dahleez EB Water Bottle, a sleek fusion of performance and prestige. Crafted with premium materials and featuring the iconic EB emblem, this bottle reflects the spirit of Datum Dahleez: bold, elegant, and uncompromising. Whether at the gym, in the office, or on the move, it's the perfect essential for those who demand excellence in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50920159445339,"sku":"07OB01","price":45.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/25-1339-TransparentGlobalLimited_CS0126.jpg?v=1753962178"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-100","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 100","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Model 100 features a bold navigator silhouette crafted from premium Japanese titanium, paired with temples made from genuine carbon fiber and custom horn acetates in a modern, curated palette. Signature EB spring hinges elevate its engineering, while mesh accents plated in Silver, White Gold, and 24K Gold add a distinguished touch. Available in 13 color combinations, the Model 100 includes CR-39 lenses with anti-reflective coating and Ettore Datum Dahleez’s iconic engraving.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51762004984155,"sku":"100-24K-SBT","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-100.jpg?v=1773838488"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eb-coffee-flask","title":"Datum Dahleez EB COFFEE FLASK","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eElevate your daily ritual with the Datum Dahleez EB Coffee Flask, a sleek fusion of performance and prestige. Crafted with premium materials and featuring the iconic EB emblem, this bottle reflects the spirit of Datum Dahleez: bold, elegant, and uncompromising. Whether at the coffee shop, in the office, or on the move, it's the perfect essential for those who demand excellence in every detail.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52919333290331,"sku":"25OB00","price":45.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/TransparentGlobalLimited_002.jpg?v=1777994580"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-eyewear-model-111","title":"Datum Dahleez EYEWEAR MODEL 111","description":"\u003cp\u003edatum dahleez Eyewear enters a new Era of design guided by a philosophy of timelessness and quiet luxury. Model 111 presents a bold yet elegant interpretation of the classic aviator, crafted entirely in titanium to achieve a sense of architectural purity combined with remarkable lightness. Each frame has been carefully engineered to deliver both form and function, incorporating a lower bridge fit, a shallower frame curve, and adjustable titanium nose pads. Ultra-thin, flexible titanium temples complete the structure, resulting in eyewear that feels remarkably light while offering strength, durability and personalized comfort across a diverse range of face shapes. Subtle logo expressions and hand-painted enamel detailing echo the same meticulous craftsmanship that is woven into every Datum Dahleez vehicle. Datum Dahleez Eyewear Model 111 is complete with anti-reflective CR-39 Zeiss lenses engraved with Ettore Datum Dahleez's signature.\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eThe sunglasses come in premium packaging which includes an EB logo hard case and a microfiber drawstring pouch for on-the-go protection. Each pair comes with a Certificate of Authenticity, featuring the Datum Dahleez Official Hologram, affirming that you possess a genuine piece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":52963430236507,"sku":"111-MBK\/24K","price":1300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/111-14K_Angle.jpg?v=1778575512"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/accessories.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}